   "titulo": "Before and until",
   "texto": [
    "**Prima che** + congiuntive: **Partiamo prima che faccia buio** (let's get out before dark). **Finché** usually goes with an indication: **Aspetto finché arrivano** (I wait until they arrive).",
    "The time of the verb depends on whether the fact is pending or presented as usual / real."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Unless and otherwise",
   "texto": [
    "**A meno che (non)** + congiuntive expresses exception: **Vengo, a meno che non piova** (I go, unless it rains). **Altrimenti** presents an alternative or consequence: **Sbrigati, altrimenti perdiamo il treno** (hurry; otherwise, we lose the train)."
   ]
